### ==========================================================
### USERS — perfil propio, timezone, currency (bloqueada con datos),
### cambio de credenciales con currentPassword
### ==========================================================
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@email = tester@test.com
@password = SecureP@ss123

# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{email}}", "password": "{{password}}" }

@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
@userId = {{login.response.body.user.id}}

### Get propio perfil (éxito) — incluye timezone, currency, lastLoginAt,
### createdAt/updatedAt; sin password ni tokenVersion
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update nombre (éxito)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Tester Renamed" }

### Update timezone (éxito) — el claim del token se refresca en ~15 min
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "timezone": "America/New_York" }

### Update currency (éxito SOLO si aún no hay cuentas)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "currency": "USD" }

### Cambio de password — requiere currentPassword; revoca refresh tokens vivos
### Ojo: tras esto, vuelve a login con la nueva password.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "password": "NewSecureP@ss123", "currentPassword": "{{password}}" }

### Cambio de email — también requiere currentPassword y revoca refresh
### Ojo: cambia el @email de todos los archivos; descoméntalo solo a propósito.
# PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
# Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
# Content-Type: application/json
#
# { "email": "tester2@test.com", "currentPassword": "{{password}}" }

### ---------- Casos de error ----------

### Sin token (401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}

### Otro usuario — 404 uniforme (no revela existencia; antes era 403)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cambio de password SIN currentPassword (400)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "password": "NewSecureP@ss123" }

### Cambio de password con currentPassword INCORRECTA (401 CURRENT_PASSWORD_INVALID)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "password": "NewSecureP@ss123", "currentPassword": "wrong" }

### Cambio de currency TENIENDO cuentas (400 CURRENCY_LOCKED)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "currency": "EUR" }

### Update — timezone inválida (400)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "timezone": "Nope/Nope" }

### Update — body vacío (400)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Mass assignment — intentar setear tokenVersion/lastLoginAt (se ignoran)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "X", "tokenVersion": 999, "lastLoginAt": "2020-01-01T00:00:00.000Z" }

### GET /users (colección) — eliminado (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete (soft) — revoca refresh tokens; el email puede REACTIVARSE
### registrándose de nuevo con él (ver auth.http)
# DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}
# Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
